| Question | Durable destination |
| --- | --- |
| 1. Purpose, users, and desired outcome | `{{OWNER_goals}}`; compact confirmed context may also be reflected in `{{OWNER_currentState}}` |
| 2. Complete workflows | `{{OWNER_goals}}` for intent, `{{OWNER_currentCapabilities}}` for confirmed supported workflows, `{{OWNER_futureCapabilities}}` for desired workflows, and `{{OWNER_currentTask}}` for admitted implementation work |
| 3. Platforms, preserved materials, and design/copy language | `{{OWNER_architecture}}` for system/source boundaries, `{{OWNER_designLanguage}}` for reusable visual/UI paths and language rules; current source/generated boundaries may also be summarized in `{{OWNER_currentState}}` |
| 4. Data, permissions, integrations, and recovery | `{{OWNER_architecture}}` for ownership/boundaries and `{{OWNER_currentTask}}` for unresolved proof or implementation work |
| 5. Success, constraints, and non-goals | `{{OWNER_goals}}`, `{{OWNER_projectHealth}}`, and `{{OWNER_currentTask}}` |

After writeback, reconcile `{{OWNER_currentState}}`, close or replace the Workflow Initialization Review checklist, and remove this protocol from conditional boot once the goal and architecture are genuinely confirmed. Keep this file as the reusable first-run protocol; do not turn it into a duplicate answer ledger.
